[0m[0m
Two spots where the C is undefined and there is no observable behavior to match: [38;5;10mcall_fma[0m with negative [38;5;10mlen[0m (invalid VLA plus an out-of-bounds [38;5;10mout[len-1][0m) returns [38;5;10m0[0m, and [38;5;10mfma_array[0m uses wrapping arithmetic for the signed multiply/add. Both are noted in comments. [38;5;10mc_src/[0m is untouched.[0m[0m
